footer PlantUML GUI: https://github.com/diosaraiva/plantuml-gui 

title UML Timing Diagram - Request Handling

' ---- Elements ----
clock "Clock" as CLK with period 50
concise "Client" as C
robust "Web Server" as WS
binary "DB Connection" as DBC

@0
C is Idle
WS is Idle
DBC is low

@100
C is Waiting
C -> WS : request
WS is Processing

@150
WS -> DBC : query
DBC is high

@250
DBC is low
WS is Responding

@300
WS -> C : response
C is Rendering
WS is Idle

@400
C is Idle

WS@100 <-> @300 : {200 ms}
DBC@150 <-> @250 : {100 ms}

@enduml